title: "Local ITS"
abstract: >
  A local Intelligent Tutoring System designed to work offline with Hugging Face
  models, based on Ruffle & Riley (Schmucker et al., 2024). Created as a proof of
  concept for benchmarking local and personalized LLMs in ITS, as part of a final
  year research project titled "Local and Personalized Large Language Models in
  Intelligent Tutoring Systems" at the University of Guyana.
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/ShivMoh/Local_ITS"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShivMoh/Local_ITS"
version: 0.1
license: GPL-3.0
keywords:
  - intelligent tutoring system
  - large language models
  - offline AI
  - educational technology
